    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Notification channel that posts formatted messages to a Slack channel via a Slack Incoming Webhook URL.</para>
<para>Severity → attachment color mapping:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>INFO → &quot;#36a64f&quot; (green)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>WARNING → &quot;#ff9900&quot; (orange)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ERROR → &quot;#e01e5a&quot; (red)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CRITICAL → &quot;#7b0000&quot; (dark red) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
